flowchart TB
    LPR[LPR plate read] --> SAP{SAP lookup}
    SAP -->|Found or miss| Dual[Middleware dual emit]

    Dual --> A[Approach A — Voice avatar]
    Dual --> B[Approach B — QR check-in]

    subgraph approachA [Approach A]
        A --> Sess[Create kiosk session]
        Sess --> Avatar[Avatar greets / not recognized]
        Avatar --> Confirm[Yes/No or STT phone]
        Confirm --> GateA[Open gate + enqueue]
    end

    subgraph approachB [Approach B]
        B --> Mint[Mint opaque Redis ticket TTL 180s]
        Mint --> QR[Kiosk shows QR + Welcome name]
        QR --> Form[Phone opens /checkin form]
        Form --> Submit[POST /checkin/submit]
        Submit --> GateB[Enqueue + rate-limited gate open]
    end

    GateA --> Queue[Shared FIFO queue — Module 2 unchanged]
    GateB --> Queue
    Queue --> Claim[50s WhatsApp claim + shift-back]
